{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §7.2"
  description: "Flattening decides what a written name means, never whether it is admitted. `a_of` flattens to `apart`, which is neither `base` nor a subtype of it, so the annotation is refused exactly as `!apart` would be."
